sequenceDiagram
    participant TM as TaskManager
    participant Q as TaskQueue
    participant LM as LifecycleManager
    participant AL as AgentLoop
    participant Act as Actor
    participant Obs as Observer
    participant TS as TaskService

    TS--)TM: TASK_CREATED 事件
    TM->>Q: push(task_id)　dag_deps 满足入 _ready，否则 _blocked
    TM->>Q: pop()　LIFO，深度优先
    TM->>TS: transition(ACTIVE)
    TM->>LM: prepare_executor(复用 / 按模板新建)
    LM->>AL: run(session, agent, task)
    AL->>AL: Reasoner.reason() → ReasoningContext
    AL->>Act: act(ctx)
    loop 上限 actor_max_tool_rounds
        Act->>Act: 调模型 → ToolGateway.call() → 结果回填
    end
    Act-->>AL: ActorResult(exit_reason)
    alt task.status == SUSPENDED
        AL->>AL: 写挂起 memory 后 return（回答后重新入队，从 run() 重来）
    else 正常路径
        AL->>Obs: observe(result, ctx, task)
        Obs->>TS: submit_task_assessment(status)　经 _TASK_TRANSITIONS 校验
    end
    AL-->>LM: agent 置 WAITING / FINISHED
    TS--)TM: TASK_EXECUTION_FINISHED 事件
    TM->>Q: notify_completed() → pop() 下一个；空则结束 session
